# Founding loop slice 6: the whole loop on base, driven from "New empty city".
#
# godot --path src/Borough.Godot -- --empty --seed 0x135283C --citizens 2000 \
#   --drive scripts/ui/founding.drive
#
# The player lays ten Streets, zones housing and trade, and places the gate and the school.
# The city grows, the treasury runs dry and the school loses its teachers. On Day 45 the player
# cuts housed_rebate from 640 to 256, and the school has its teachers back by Day 60.
#
# Up to Day 45 the session's Input Log is rulesets/base/founding.borough, byte for byte, and
# BaseFoundingPackageTests measures the same city headless. Run with BOROUGH_LOG=1 to write it.
# The window is pinned, so every photograph has the same frame.

